## Context

Request from project climate-finance-het (author decisions of 2026-11-10,
interactive). Reading notes for the REL literature review, the HET paper and
the book (about 160 notes) are drafted mostly by agents. The author decided:

- Zotero is the primary store of reading notes, as HTML child notes under the
  work's item; the author reads and corrects them in Zotero's note editor.
- Git is the draft-review lane: agents draft the HTML note on a branch, it is
  reviewed and merged, then published to Zotero.
- Project wikis rebuild their reading-note pages from Zotero inside a thin
  generated .qmd envelope (title plus the note as a raw HTML block).
- Nothing records the acquisition channel of a document.

Today `rules/zotero.md` and `skills/reading-note/SKILL.md` §4 say notes never
live in a repo and file a note as a standalone Document with an .md
attachment. That stays compatible in spirit (Zotero is the record) but the
note becomes an HTML child note, and repos hold generated snapshots.

Measured 2026-11-10: a test note written through the web API and edited in
Zotero's editor kept tables (adds <tbody>, wraps cells in <p>), heading id
attributes, blockquotes, math (span/pre class="math") and links; it dropped
custom class and data-* attributes. The web key `ZOTERO_RW_API_KEY` in
~/.config/keys/zotero.env has write access (an empty POST answered 200;
the read key answered 403), so publishing needs no running desktop.

## Choices (MOE-recommended unless marked)

- `rules/zotero.md`: narrow to "Zotero is the record for works and reading
  notes; repositories hold drafts under review and generated snapshots".
- zotero skill: verb `publish-notes` (merged HTML drafts -> child notes under
  `zotero_item`, idempotent by a `wiki_slug` + `project` key in the note's
  field table, update in place, never duplicate; reports Zotero unreachable
  as unavailable, never as in sync) and verb `pull-notes` (child notes of a
  project -> envelope pages). Web API with the read-write key.
- lair: beside step 11, offer "N merged notes not yet published: publish?"
  when merged drafts are ahead of Zotero; proposal only, as for check-staging.
- reading-note skill: template and filing switched to the HTML child note;
  caps 700 words deep / 250 skim (author-decided for climate-finance-het).

## Consumers

climate-finance-het ticket 3019 (wiki-pull, 61 pages to migrate);
sen-causal-reading (73 reading pages with 103 anchor links; ticket there).

